WEBVTT

00:06.080 --> 00:08.540
I can't believe they're 
attacking us as well...

00:09.150 --> 00:13.300
Kai and Cyan are too cruel!

00:13.300 --> 00:14.790
What is this?!

00:15.710 --> 00:17.480
<i>If I had my normal powers,</i>

00:17.480 --> 00:20.080
<i>those strange beasts would fall before me!</i>

00:20.080 --> 00:23.950
<i>This is all because my followers 
were getting stolen left and right!</i>

00:24.510 --> 00:27.220
<i>Yukito, you idiot!</i>

00:31.040 --> 00:35.170
There's no way you can get away 
from the pets we borrowed from Mom.

00:35.170 --> 00:39.580
I will never forgive anyone 
who destroys our family!

00:39.580 --> 01:50.050


00:40.010 --> 00:45.020
Episode 11
We know we are not worthy
O great Lord Mitama
In the ancient tim—

00:40.430 --> 00:41.600
We know we are not worthy

00:41.600 --> 00:43.020
O great Lord Mitama

00:43.020 --> 00:45.020
In the ancient tim—

00:45.850 --> 00:50.520
<i>Everyone in this country is 
born through artificial means.</i>

00:50.520 --> 00:52.400
<i>Once they reach a certain age,</i>

00:52.400 --> 00:56.990
<i>they are registered as the child of a couple 
in the capital per the assembly's instructions.</i>

00:58.030 --> 00:59.280
What is your name?

01:02.750 --> 01:03.830
Cyan.

01:04.160 --> 01:05.540
That's an adorable name.

01:05.540 --> 01:07.290
It fits you well.

01:07.710 --> 01:09.790
Thank you, Mom!

01:10.250 --> 01:13.260
Cyan, why don't the three 
of us all go shopping?

01:13.840 --> 01:15.470
Okay, Father!

01:16.180 --> 01:20.640
<i>There was nothing special 
about my mother and father.</i>

01:20.640 --> 01:22.850
<i>They were ordinary in every way.</i>

01:23.560 --> 01:28.980
<i>But they were always so considerate 
and took great care of me.</i>

01:29.730 --> 01:33.360
<i>Being with my family gave me a warm feeling.</i>

01:34.360 --> 01:38.990
<i>That's why I loved my father and my mother.</i>

01:38.990 --> 01:41.620
<i>And then all of a sudden, that happened...</i>

01:41.620 --> 01:42.450
This is so good!

01:42.790 --> 01:46.460
Your cooking is so amazing, Mom!

01:46.460 --> 01:47.500
That's right.

01:47.500 --> 01:49.580
Her cooking is the best.

01:49.580 --> 01:52.460
Oh, both of you are such flatterers.

01:55.460 --> 01:58.970
Capital citizen number 1080742.

01:58.970 --> 02:02.260
According to the assembly's instructions, 
you are to end your life.

02:02.600 --> 02:04.810
Gracefully accept your fate.

02:05.810 --> 02:06.480
I shall.

02:15.230 --> 02:16.360
Wait!

02:16.360 --> 02:18.490
Please don't take my father away!

02:18.490 --> 02:19.820
Don't take him away!

02:21.490 --> 02:24.330
Is this girl rebelling 
against the end of life?

02:27.200 --> 02:29.830
Put that girl into an isolation camp.

02:29.830 --> 02:30.290
Huh?

02:31.380 --> 02:34.340
We have raised her according to 
the assembly's instructions.

02:35.460 --> 02:36.960
But she still turned out oddly.

02:36.960 --> 02:39.880
She laughs and cries quite a bit.

02:37.550 --> 02:40.510
Father! Mother!

02:39.880 --> 02:41.890
She is not fit for the capital.

02:46.310 --> 02:49.350
<i>My parents were not like me.</i>

02:49.350 --> 02:50.480
<i>In the capital's eyes,</i>

02:50.480 --> 02:53.020
<i>they were completely ordinary people.</i>

02:53.650 --> 02:54.730
<i>I won't forgive them.</i>

02:55.270 --> 02:56.530
<i>I was deceived.</i>

02:56.530 --> 02:57.480
<i>That was not my family.</i>

02:58.030 --> 03:01.280
You're about the same age as me, huh?

02:58.360 --> 03:00.740
Father. Mother.

03:01.280 --> 03:02.410
I won't forgive.

03:01.280 --> 03:03.620
So you got sent to the isolation camp, too?

03:02.950 --> 03:03.620
I won't forgive.

03:04.530 --> 03:05.530
They deceived me.

03:05.950 --> 03:06.950
Deceived me.

03:07.490 --> 03:08.750
Not family.

03:09.120 --> 03:11.330
Why? I won't forgive.

03:15.630 --> 03:16.960
Please help me!

03:17.920 --> 03:18.880
Shit!

03:18.880 --> 03:19.590
This way!

03:28.180 --> 03:29.480
Oh, my.

03:30.020 --> 03:32.900
Looks like I was a little late.

03:33.600 --> 03:36.150
Most of them are dead.

03:36.860 --> 03:39.570
The assembly might yell at me for this.

03:45.530 --> 03:48.950
So your parents betrayed you, did they?

03:51.660 --> 03:53.290
I see.

03:55.290 --> 03:59.130
How could such sweet children 
suffer such cruel betrayal?

03:59.130 --> 04:01.220
It must have been so tough!

04:01.220 --> 04:04.890
Such pain, ripping through your chests!

04:05.430 --> 04:06.510
Y-Yeah...?

04:06.930 --> 04:10.560
I understand your pain.

04:10.560 --> 04:11.560
Understand?

04:13.520 --> 04:15.600
What could you know about this?!

04:18.820 --> 04:19.980
More!

04:19.980 --> 04:23.120
You can hit me more!

04:23.120 --> 04:24.240
More!

04:25.490 --> 04:27.490
You can hit me more!

04:28.120 --> 04:29.660
Such a treat...

04:30.240 --> 04:33.620
I mean, if it would make you feel better.

04:36.960 --> 04:38.500
Cyan-chan.

04:39.630 --> 04:41.550
Let's start over.

04:41.550 --> 04:44.300
Let's make a family.

04:44.760 --> 04:46.510
<i>This time around,</i>

04:46.510 --> 04:48.720
<i>I won't fail at making a family!</i>

04:51.430 --> 04:52.350
What the...?

05:00.480 --> 05:01.780
Mom's pets!

05:02.150 --> 05:03.820
Good job, Atar-tan!

05:03.820 --> 05:05.320
I'm totes grateful!

05:05.320 --> 05:07.450
Not at all like that impotent Yuki-tan!

05:07.450 --> 05:08.280
T-Too close.

05:08.660 --> 05:10.620
Who the hell are you?

05:10.950 --> 05:12.790
I am the ultimate deity, Mitama-sama,

05:12.790 --> 05:14.290
and these are my underlings!

05:14.660 --> 05:17.540
Did you see that? Did you witness my power?

05:14.660 --> 05:18.210
I'd have preferred if you had 
gotten them all, Dakini.

05:17.540 --> 05:18.960
That was not your power.

05:18.210 --> 05:20.420
Then give me my followers back.

05:18.210 --> 05:21.130
The power of a god's underlings 
is the power of the god!

05:21.130 --> 05:22.630
I am not your underling.

05:21.460 --> 05:23.170
How dare you speak like that, underling?!

05:23.170 --> 05:24.340
Right, then.

05:25.300 --> 05:27.590
If it's just two, it shouldn't be a problem.

05:27.590 --> 05:29.800
We will reform them with 
psychological, physical,

05:29.800 --> 05:32.310
or whatever other means necessary.

05:32.310 --> 05:33.470
Hmm...

05:32.310 --> 05:35.060
I'm very familiar with such methods.

05:37.650 --> 05:39.230
I'll kill you!

05:40.520 --> 05:42.320
The ground is shaking?

05:43.280 --> 05:44.530
What is this?

05:44.530 --> 05:45.900
What's going on?

05:48.320 --> 05:49.240
Yukito.

05:49.240 --> 05:50.740
We should get out of here!

05:50.740 --> 05:51.580
What?

05:53.370 --> 05:56.160
You've really done it, Yukito-kun.

05:56.790 --> 05:58.000
Gaia.

06:00.040 --> 06:02.380
You kept me busy with the band stuff,

06:02.380 --> 06:06.510
and in the meantime you 
separated my kids from me.

06:06.920 --> 06:09.050
Yukito, come on!

06:11.180 --> 06:14.560
You better not do anything silly 
in our group going forward.

06:14.560 --> 06:17.640
Even if you gain followers, 
we'll just take them away from you.

06:18.690 --> 06:19.940
Going forward?

06:20.770 --> 06:24.150
There is no going forward.

06:24.820 --> 06:26.400
This is the end.

06:28.650 --> 06:29.410
What's happening?

06:29.410 --> 06:30.530
Here it comes!

06:36.870 --> 06:37.910
Yukito!

06:42.670 --> 06:44.840
What... is that?

06:49.050 --> 06:51.640
It's earlier than planned.

06:51.970 --> 06:53.430
But it should suffice.

06:53.430 --> 06:54.460
Mom!

06:54.460 --> 06:55.310
Mom!

06:55.640 --> 06:57.560
Cyan! Kai!

06:57.930 --> 07:00.810
Mom, I knew you'd come help us!

07:01.350 --> 07:03.230
You did wonderfully.

07:03.230 --> 07:07.570
I'm really proud of you for not 
giving in to those evil adults.

07:08.820 --> 07:09.610
Thanks.

07:10.110 --> 07:13.160
I really mean it.

07:13.160 --> 07:15.830
Mom, what exactly is that strange beast?

07:17.450 --> 07:21.710
You've truly done so well until now.

07:23.580 --> 07:24.540
But...

07:27.460 --> 07:30.970
I don't need you anymore.

07:30.970 --> 07:32.630
What is this?!

07:33.140 --> 07:34.180
What?!

07:35.220 --> 07:36.060
Mom!

07:36.060 --> 07:37.810
Help us, Mom!

07:36.350 --> 07:37.810
What the hell!?

07:37.810 --> 07:39.270
Let us out from here!

07:39.270 --> 07:41.350
Why aren't you helping us?

07:41.350 --> 07:43.850
Your family needs you!

07:45.940 --> 07:47.570
I'm sorry.

07:47.570 --> 07:49.230
What is a family?

07:49.230 --> 07:51.740
I don't know, myself.

07:52.910 --> 07:54.990
Damn you!

07:54.990 --> 07:56.700
I'm sorry.

07:56.700 --> 07:59.080
Aren't we a family?

07:59.080 --> 08:01.750
Family time is over.

08:02.960 --> 08:03.830
Mom...

08:04.500 --> 08:06.540
Mom! Mom!

08:04.500 --> 08:07.420
You bitch! Get us out of here!

08:13.510 --> 08:16.970
Mobile biological fortress, Typhon.

08:16.970 --> 08:21.520
Its power vastly surpasses 
that of even archons.

08:24.600 --> 08:26.810
No way, no way! This is impossible for real!

08:27.480 --> 08:29.570
What the hell is that stupidly huge thing?

08:31.690 --> 08:32.490
Cain!

08:32.490 --> 08:33.450
Cain.

08:44.960 --> 08:46.330
That didn't do anything.

08:46.960 --> 08:48.210
This is bad.

08:50.460 --> 08:53.260
Don't mess with a god!

09:04.350 --> 09:05.850
I did it.

09:05.850 --> 09:08.150
But I'm too...

09:09.480 --> 09:11.320
Bow, Mitama.

09:11.320 --> 09:12.230
You gotta bow!

09:13.650 --> 09:15.110
You did it before, remember?

09:15.110 --> 09:17.660
Bow to seal away that god's power!

09:17.660 --> 09:19.450
That's crazy!

09:19.450 --> 09:20.490
Why?!

09:20.910 --> 09:24.790
Unlike Dakini, that thing's original 
god doesn't understand words.

09:24.790 --> 09:26.250
That's the kind of monster he is.

09:26.620 --> 09:28.330
What the hell does that mean?

09:29.630 --> 09:30.960
Let's get out of here.

09:30.960 --> 09:31.960
How, though?

09:32.420 --> 09:34.720
There's no way you can run 
from a monster like that.

09:35.130 --> 09:36.590
It's impossible, for real!

09:46.480 --> 09:47.480
Get in!

09:49.690 --> 09:51.070
Sorry we took so long.

09:51.070 --> 09:52.440
Sil! Al!

09:52.440 --> 09:54.900
Oh! We're here to save you!

09:54.900 --> 09:56.110
Hurry up and get in.

09:56.110 --> 09:56.650
Right.

09:57.280 --> 09:58.950
Is everyone ready?

09:58.950 --> 09:59.490
Yup!

09:59.490 --> 10:00.620
Yes.

10:01.660 --> 10:02.660
So cramped...

10:02.660 --> 10:04.660
You dirty little brat.

10:04.660 --> 10:06.620
Get away from Yukito!

10:06.620 --> 10:08.460
Don't you worry, Mitama-tan.

10:08.460 --> 10:09.880
You will develop soon, too.

10:09.880 --> 10:13.050
I have been in my final form 
for 100 trillion light years!

10:13.050 --> 10:14.960
Hold on tight!

10:14.960 --> 10:17.010
Here we go!

10:21.140 --> 10:22.470
Fast

10:21.140 --> 10:22.470
Serious

10:21.140 --> 10:22.470
Intense

10:21.140 --> 10:22.470
Danger

10:28.390 --> 10:29.980
Nitro

10:37.240 --> 10:38.110
Right!

10:38.110 --> 10:39.030
Front!

10:41.870 --> 10:44.330
I knew you'd be good at this, Al.

10:45.450 --> 10:47.910
Maybe because you're sitting next to me.

10:47.910 --> 10:49.460
Hold on tight!

10:49.460 --> 10:51.000
You better not lose your breakfast!

11:15.610 --> 11:17.070
We got away...

11:17.070 --> 11:19.860
What was that strange beast, anyway?

11:19.860 --> 11:21.320
That was Typhon.

11:21.700 --> 11:24.330
The most powerful strange 
beast mom can create.

11:25.950 --> 11:29.870
I've been alive for over ten thousand 
years and I've never seen it before!

11:29.870 --> 11:34.340
How could Gaia control that 
with her measly two followers?

11:34.340 --> 11:36.630
Because you don't need power to control it.

11:36.960 --> 11:39.590
It does take a long time to create,

11:39.590 --> 11:43.140
but since it's so obedient, 
you barely need any power to use it.

11:43.140 --> 11:44.720
The cost-performance ratio is amazing.

11:45.140 --> 11:47.100
Why do you know all that?

11:47.510 --> 11:49.810
Yushii knows everything!

11:49.810 --> 11:52.390
He knows the most in our group.

11:52.690 --> 11:57.320
I read about Typhon in a book from 
the old civilization mom gave me.

11:57.320 --> 11:58.650
Old civilization?

11:58.650 --> 12:01.030
The civilization before the Empire.

12:01.820 --> 12:05.490
<i>I don't know why Gaia had a book 
from the old civilization...</i>

12:06.080 --> 12:08.450
<i>But does this mean this kid 
read and understood a book</i>

12:08.450 --> 12:10.330
<i>from a time with hyper advanced technology</i>

12:10.700 --> 12:13.040
<i>that even I don't understand?</i>

12:15.210 --> 12:17.630
This is the power of a god, Yukito!

12:18.000 --> 12:20.550
Ice cream is tasty, huh, Yukito?

12:21.170 --> 12:23.090
Ah, Yukito-san! Ah!

12:23.510 --> 12:25.840
Let's drink, Yukito!

12:25.840 --> 12:28.850
Y-Yukito, you're saying you need me?

12:28.850 --> 12:30.520
Sessions <i>are</i> love!

12:30.520 --> 12:31.640
Isn't that right, Yuki-tan?

12:31.640 --> 12:34.060
I will not surrender to you, Yukito!

12:34.440 --> 12:36.360
I'm going to build a life with my right hand!

12:41.740 --> 12:43.700
The books from the old civilization 
are so interesting.

12:44.280 --> 12:48.280
Yushii-kun, I have a big favor to ask of you.

12:49.240 --> 12:52.040
It looks like that strange 
beast didn't follow us.

12:52.540 --> 12:56.210
I guess the nitro was just too much for it.

12:56.210 --> 12:58.040
We should go back to the village first and—

13:00.500 --> 13:02.210
What's happening?

13:02.210 --> 13:06.640
So that thing we first saw was 
just a small part of its body...

13:09.640 --> 13:11.850
Nothing should be this big!

13:11.850 --> 13:13.890
What we need to do now is get far away!

13:25.280 --> 13:26.410
Out of the way!

13:26.410 --> 13:27.910
Yukito!

13:28.280 --> 13:29.740
Yukito, hang in there!

13:29.740 --> 13:32.950
I'm here with you, so it's okay!

13:32.950 --> 13:34.830
Let go of him!

13:36.620 --> 13:39.290
I'll save you if it's the last thing I do!

13:39.290 --> 13:40.340
Yukito!

13:47.680 --> 13:48.390
Wha?

13:50.760 --> 13:52.810
Yukito's... dead?

13:58.020 --> 14:00.310
Yukito and Mitama... were killed?

14:00.770 --> 14:02.360
Are you serious?

14:02.820 --> 14:05.780
There's no way they could have 
survived that predicament.

14:09.370 --> 14:10.320
We're so sorry.

14:10.740 --> 14:12.200
This is because of us.

14:12.990 --> 14:15.200
It's not your fault.

14:15.200 --> 14:18.290
What am I going to do now?

14:18.290 --> 14:20.670
Now that Mitama-sama and Yukito are dead?!

14:20.670 --> 14:22.460
Th-Th-That's right!

14:22.460 --> 14:25.960
Without Yukito, I'm completely helpless!

14:26.340 --> 14:28.090
If it's just defending the village,

14:28.090 --> 14:30.090
Atar can handle it...

14:30.430 --> 14:35.180
But it was Yukito and Mitama-chan who held the 
villagers and our religious group together.

14:35.770 --> 14:37.100
If it's just us, we're...

14:37.100 --> 15:47.210


14:47.210 --> 14:50.090
What is this place?

14:53.390 --> 14:54.740
Is that...

14:56.260 --> 14:57.450
...blood?

14:57.450 --> 14:59.710
It looks like you're awake,

15:02.460 --> 15:04.690
Yukito-kun.

15:05.940 --> 15:07.720
Oh, my.

15:10.400 --> 15:11.550
Who are you?

15:11.950 --> 15:14.070
Gaia, of course.

15:14.070 --> 15:18.810
You do know that archons 
have a combat form, right?

15:19.370 --> 15:21.770
<i>Yours is just too different.</i>

15:21.770 --> 15:24.420
We're inside the body of Typhon.

15:24.420 --> 15:28.130
It's strange that there's 
a room like this inside,

15:28.130 --> 15:31.300
but that's strange beasts for you.

15:31.300 --> 15:34.830
By the way, it looks like you can't die.

15:35.050 --> 15:35.830
What?

15:36.050 --> 15:39.640
Not even getting eaten 
by Typhon could kill you.

15:39.640 --> 15:42.690
Then I stabbed you, 
crushed you, sliced you up,

15:42.690 --> 15:44.770
burned you, gouged and carved you.

15:44.770 --> 15:47.650
I killed you about 300 times,

15:47.650 --> 15:49.320
but nothing worked.

15:49.320 --> 15:51.900
You keep coming back to life.

15:51.900 --> 15:56.120
Looks like she's reviving you infinitely,

15:56.120 --> 16:00.240
even though she used up her power
 and is utterly depleted already.

16:00.240 --> 16:02.080
Yukito...

16:01.040 --> 16:03.330
I guess you're loved.

16:03.330 --> 16:07.710
Or maybe you're cursed?

16:20.970 --> 16:21.930
What are you...?

16:20.970 --> 16:23.060
When I'm in this form,

16:23.060 --> 16:27.980
even you look young and so delicious.

16:31.820 --> 16:32.930
The capital?

16:32.930 --> 16:35.780
Is this monster moving towards the capital?

16:35.780 --> 16:37.870
Yes, that's right.

16:40.530 --> 16:42.620
I'm not going to give up!

16:42.620 --> 16:43.440
Al...

16:43.440 --> 16:46.150
There's no way our Yukito-san 
could die that easily!

16:46.500 --> 16:49.920
After all, Mitama-chan is an 
amazing person called a god!

16:49.920 --> 16:51.130
A god, huh?

16:51.130 --> 16:54.170
That's right! Not that 
I know much about gods,

16:54.170 --> 16:55.130
but she is incredible!

16:55.130 --> 16:57.930
I was her very first follower, 
so I should know!

16:57.930 --> 16:59.470
Yukito is amazing, too!

16:59.470 --> 17:01.470
He keeps my heart alive!

17:01.470 --> 17:03.680
I'm sure they're both alive!

17:05.730 --> 17:06.380
Huh?

17:06.850 --> 17:08.600
The pendant I got from Yukito.

17:12.980 --> 17:14.280
Mitama-chan?

17:16.090 --> 17:19.660
Yukito, Mitama,

17:16.090 --> 17:19.660
and children are alive

17:20.700 --> 17:22.160
This is...!

17:22.160 --> 17:23.240
What?

17:23.240 --> 17:26.160
The letters Mitama-chan uses sometimes.

17:26.160 --> 17:28.230
We can't read them, though.

17:28.620 --> 17:31.460
It says that Yukito and 
Mitama are still alive,

17:31.460 --> 17:33.920
and so are are my brother 
Kai and my sister Cyan.

17:33.920 --> 17:34.450
What?!

17:34.760 --> 17:35.880
Really?!

17:38.760 --> 17:41.050
Yushii-kun, you can read this?

17:41.050 --> 17:41.540
Yes.

17:44.260 --> 17:47.500
It looks like everyone 
is trapped inside Typhon.

17:50.350 --> 17:51.230
Al.

17:52.310 --> 17:52.900
Yes.

17:53.320 --> 17:55.340
Everyone, let's do this!

17:55.820 --> 17:58.090
There must be a way to save them!

17:58.490 --> 18:00.490
My little sister's right.

18:00.490 --> 18:02.530
Well, at least we can try.

18:02.530 --> 18:04.200
I'm in, too!

18:04.200 --> 18:05.450
I guess.

18:05.450 --> 18:06.200
Yeah!

18:08.460 --> 18:09.830
Now, then.

18:09.830 --> 18:11.650
Dakini, Riche.

18:12.210 --> 18:13.030
Huh?

18:13.030 --> 18:15.740
You're going to help us, too.

18:16.300 --> 18:19.380
So you think you can beat Loki 
with that follower count?

18:21.010 --> 18:24.430
With my Typhon, it'll be easy.

18:24.430 --> 18:28.310
After that, I'll just destroy 
the other archons one by one.

18:29.890 --> 18:31.940
We were unconscious.

18:31.940 --> 18:33.060
Where are we?

18:33.060 --> 18:34.980
Hey, Yukito-kun,

18:34.980 --> 18:39.070
do you know about the 
world before the Empire?

18:39.070 --> 18:41.610
Loki told me a little about it.

18:41.610 --> 18:44.200
An extremely scientifically advanced world.

18:44.200 --> 18:45.520
What of it?

18:45.990 --> 18:49.540
Archons are a type of half-human 
biological weapons

18:49.540 --> 18:55.540
that were created during that time 
by messing with human bodies.

18:55.540 --> 19:01.380
But it seems all the archons besides myself 
have lost their memories of those times.

19:02.410 --> 19:07.560
Back when I was born, 
science ruled the world.

19:08.680 --> 19:15.460
But a very small group of humans obstinately 
insisted that they wanted to live in nature,

19:15.460 --> 19:17.980
so they formed communities for that.

19:19.440 --> 19:23.700
My mother was a leader of one such community.

19:24.240 --> 19:27.810
My mother made me into the 
"god" of the community.

19:28.330 --> 19:30.870
She was an unrefined person.

19:31.410 --> 19:37.040
To her, the founding members of the 
community and I were just tools to

19:37.040 --> 19:43.180
fulfill her thirst for 
power and material wealth.

20:22.970 --> 20:27.800
In the end, I ran away from her 
and destroyed her community.

20:31.890 --> 20:33.980
After that, without anyone to turn to,

20:33.980 --> 20:37.380
the government took me in 
and remade me into an archon.

20:38.270 --> 20:42.650
Well, the archons all share 
a similar origin story.

20:42.650 --> 20:44.300
That's our nature.

20:44.740 --> 20:46.070
Your nature?

20:46.070 --> 20:47.680
What is that supposed to mean?

20:49.160 --> 20:52.940
You smell just like my mother.

20:53.700 --> 20:55.960
The putrid smell of absolute trash.

20:55.960 --> 20:59.080
You deceive people with your silver 
tongue and then exploit them.

20:59.080 --> 21:04.510
No wonder you were able to 
grow your group so quickly.

21:04.510 --> 21:05.660
Deceive?

21:05.970 --> 21:06.530
Yes!

21:06.930 --> 21:09.550
You employed various methods 
to control people,

21:09.550 --> 21:12.510
muddled their thoughts, and lured them in.

21:12.510 --> 21:17.170
The people in your village are 
merely victims who were conned.

21:17.600 --> 21:19.730
That's not true, I...

21:19.730 --> 21:20.960
It isn't?

21:23.860 --> 21:28.780
Can you really say that you haven't 
been lying to the people around you?

21:30.990 --> 21:36.210
<i>I... in my previous world I 
didn't have single friend.</i>

21:36.210 --> 21:38.830
<i>I never had a decent relationship 
with anyone ever.</i>

21:39.380 --> 21:41.790
<i>I never showed my true self,</i>

21:41.790 --> 21:43.340
<i>I sized up others,</i>

21:43.340 --> 21:45.920
<i>then got them in line 
with my acts and words...</i>

21:46.510 --> 21:50.370
<i>That's the only way I know how 
to interact with others...</i>

21:50.970 --> 21:54.060
<i>I've only ever said things that 
didn't come from my heart,</i>

21:54.560 --> 21:56.770
<i>and used that to win others over...</i>

21:56.770 --> 22:02.150
If it's for your self, you will deceive and 
exploit any and everyone, and then discard them.

22:02.150 --> 22:03.270
Shut up!

22:03.270 --> 22:05.030
You're exactly the same!

22:05.030 --> 22:06.280
That's right.

22:06.280 --> 22:08.400
You and I are cut from the same cloth.

22:08.400 --> 22:12.530
The tactics that my mother implanted 
in me are still on me like a stain.

22:16.200 --> 22:20.440
You know, I hate so-called gods.

22:20.920 --> 22:28.010
You and the other archons who are trying to 
revive the world of gods make me want to puke.

22:28.380 --> 22:31.450
I'm going to destroy it all.

22:32.260 --> 22:34.660
I deceived the people of the village.

22:35.180 --> 22:37.920
To them, I'm...

22:38.230 --> 22:39.710
A precious friend!

22:41.710 --> 22:44.730
What was that?

22:53.120 --> 22:56.120
Yukito!

22:56.620 --> 23:01.150
You and Mitama-chan have 
saved us time and time again!

23:01.770 --> 23:04.030
Now it's our turn to save you!

23:04.480 --> 23:05.780
Everyone!

23:05.780 --> 23:07.260
Here we go!

23:12.040 --> 23:13.910
What is this?

23:14.460 --> 23:16.300
What are they planning to do?

23:17.170 --> 23:17.890
Ready?

23:18.530 --> 23:19.200
Yes.

23:19.760 --> 23:22.560
We also want to know Mom's true intentions.

23:22.560 --> 23:22.970
Yes!

23:23.520 --> 23:26.950
Good, then let's do this!

23:27.860 --> 23:32.340
You're going to return Yukito-san,

23:32.340 --> 23:34.290
our precious friend!

23:35.060 --> 23:40.020
Episode 12
We know we are not worthy
O great Lord Mitama
On the throne—

23:35.510 --> 23:37.520
We know we are not worthy

23:37.520 --> 23:39.100
O great Lord Mitama

23:39.100 --> 23:40.020
On the throne—
